  "rewrites": {
   "1": {
    "original": "The bill would also reinstate the Foreign Intelligence Surveillance Act\u2019s (FISA\u2019s) 70-day period for federal agents to surveil somebody without approaching a court; previous iterations allowed NSA to surveil someone without approaching a court for up to a year.",
